      Q. Q. 4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِكْوَهَدَّ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a young bird) <i>trembled,</i>
or <i>fluttered, before its mother, that she might
feed it:</i> (S, L:) and <i>he</i> (an old man) <i>trembled:</i>
(L:) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِقْمَهَدَّ</span>. (K.)

